  unitName: Torturous Grief Zellha
  unitId: 50477
  unitNumber: 1455
  description: Had Zellha not been stopped by a disciple and her invasion of the
    Bariura Empire proceeded as planned, she might have succeeded in seizing the
    magical secrets of the dark magician who deceived her and in making them her
    own. In that case, the gods likely would have been as helpless to stop her rampage
    as humans had been before. Her presence would have definitely acted as a major
    chaotic element in the conflict between the great gods that followed as well.
  summonDesc: I gained power, haven't I?<br>So let's tear the world apart!<br>You're
    into the idea, right?
  fusionDesc: No, this is not enough in the absolute! I've become incomparably beautiful,
    so you must give me something incomparable, too!
  evoDesc: Hmph! This is pretty handy, for a technique he created! Where shall we
    head off to annihilate first?
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
